From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] compat: explicitly convert buffer shared pointer to bool

Forky hyprutils uses an explicit CSharedPointer boolean conversion.

--- a/src/protocols/types/Buffer.cpp
+++ b/src/protocols/types/Buffer.cpp
@@ -114,7 +114,7 @@ SP<IHLBuffer> CHLBufferReference::operator->() const {
 
 CHLBufferReference::operator bool() const {
-    return m_buffer;
+    return static_cast<bool>(m_buffer);
 }
 
 void CHLBufferReference::drop() {